    "Scan of the 1978 edition of the Isleton, California, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1976; aerial photographs from 1974; photo inspected in 1991; photo revised in 1993; last revised in 1978; printed in 1993.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.4 x 26.7 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
